    "headline": "IQVIA’s (NYSE:IQV) Q2 CY2026 Sales Top Estimates, Stock Soars",
    "summary": "Clinical research company IQVIA (NYSE: IQV) beat Wall Street’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 8.7% year on year to $4.37 billion. The company’s full-year revenue guidance of $17.38 billion at the midpoint came in 0.5% above analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $3.15 per share was 3.9% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
